'''Bergritte Battle-Born''' is an [[Skyrim:Elder|elderly]] [[Skyrim:Nord|Nord]] living in the [[Skyrim:House of Clan Battle-Born|House of Clan Battle-Born]] in [[Skyrim:Whiterun|Whiterun]]. She is the wife of [[Skyrim:Olfrid Battle-Born|Olfrid Battle-Born]] and has two children, [[Skyrim:Jon Battle-Born|Jon]] and [[Skyrim:Alfhild Battle-Born|Alfhild]]. Alfhild is married to [[Skyrim:Idolaf Battle-Born|Idolaf]] and they have given Bergritte her first grandchild, [[Skyrim:Lars Battle-Born|Lars]].

As family elder, she lives a relatively anonymous existence in Whiterun. She wakes up early at 6am and spends her morning in her favorite chair, eating and relaxing. At noon she heads over to the Gildergreen and listens to [[Skyrim:Heimskr|Heimskr]]'s ramblings until she goes down to the market at 3pm. At 6pm she returns to the house for some dinner before her bedtime at 8pm. 

She wears a set of farmer [[Skyrim:Clothing#000209a6|clothes]] with a pair of [[Skyrim:Clothing#000209a5|boots]] and a [[Skyrim:Clothing#000209aa|hat]]. She carries the [[Skyrim:Key to House Battle-Born|house key]], an [[Skyrim:Iron Dagger|iron dagger]], and a selection of [[Skyrim:Leveled Lists#Common|common items and gold]]. 
